        <activityName xml:lang="en">Use of wireless IP access network per GB</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Use of wireless IP access network per GB
The data set represents the mix of wireless networks in Switzerland; UUID: fa98e92e-eb41-3b3b-81b5-2fbd27beb87f
The datasets represents the split of 2-4G and 5G networks in Switzerland for the year 2020, based on information from Swisscom and study of Bieser et al 2021. The functional unit = 1 GB.
Location: Data for Swiss networks
Technology: The mix of Swiss access transmission network, wireless. 2-4G and 5G technologies are considered.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: Average technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_fa98e92e-eb41-3b3b-81b5-2fbd27beb87f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
